Z||000000||skitime||03-26-2001||11:39 AM||||Ok time for new GT quarter windows. Who makes the best one and how much do they cost? I tried a search but am not finding much info. What is the best price anyone has found for factory ones? Gmpartsdirect list them for 149.08 for the left one and 141.29 for the right one. These prices are with shipping. Some reproductions are tinted but they also tint the GT emblem which I don't like. Other reproductions are clear which is not orginal either.  Does someone make and exact reproduction?<P>BTW, if anyone wants to do some searching the GM part numbers are 20701106 for the right one and 20701107 for the left. <p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 03-26-2001).]||||reg||1
